</center><H1 ALIGN=CENTER>Knights Guild Info</H1>

<BLOCKQUOTE>
<br><hr><br>
<pre>

File updated March, 2006. 


You ask around about the knights' guild.
Name: The Legion of Knights
Command: knight
Creators: Shinarae and Elwood
Maximum level: 15


Description:
Knights are the honourable champions of the kingdom or region in which they
serve. It is their sworn duty to protect the land and its people. Most knights
are worthy fighters, capable of using strong armour and mighty weapons, and
can fight equally well on horseback or on foot. While different knights may
act in different ways -- some seek power and glory, others the greater good --
they have a Code of behavior that they follow. They strive to be the best
through the routes of Education, Conduct, Valor, and Skill.


Joining requirements:
 Background must be civilized (passed)
 Must be maximum level in Squire (not a member)
Abilities gained when joining:
 Knights gain power through their dedication to the Code.
 You receive a crest to show your rank amongst fellow knights.
 May train skill Attack to 48%
 May train skill Long blades to 28%
 May train skill Axes to 28%
 May train skill Bludgeons to 28%
 May train skill Shield bash to 9%
 May train skill Combat sense to 9%
